# AI Webpage PDF Assistant — Environment Variables
# Chrome extensions cannot read .env files at runtime (no Node.js).
# This file is for documentation and local reference only.
#
# To use your Gemini key:
#   Option A (dev shortcut): paste it into shared/config.js
#   Option B (recommended):  enter it in the extension's Settings page (gear icon)
#
# Get a key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey

GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here